Third-party work
----------------

Parts of server/market/engine.py (the median, clean-price, similarity and quick-sale rules) are
adapted from Coflnet's SkySniper, https://github.com/Coflnet/SkySniper, licensed under the
GNU Affero General Public License v3.0. Methods taken from it keep their original names in
comments (GetMedian, GetCleanItemPrice, GetEstimatedMedian, SimilarityByMarketPrice,
InstaSellPrice) so each adapted rule can be traced to its source. The rules were rewritten in
Python and changed for Dragsim's items, stack sizes, fees and market.

The hover price lines (server/market/lore.py) follow the format of Coflnet's SkyApi mod
descriptions, https://github.com/Coflnet/SkyApi (AGPL-3.0).
